<h2 data-start="5321" data-end="5334">7. Summary</h2>
<p data-start="5336" data-end="5413">Patom Theory can be seen as a <strong data-start="5366" data-end="5391">mesoscale realization</strong> of the RSVP paradigm:</p>
<ul data-start="5414" data-end="5826">
<li data-start="5414" data-end="5461">
<p data-start="5416" data-end="5461">It discretizes what RSVP treats continuously.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5462" data-end="5579">
<p data-start="5464" data-end="5579">It implements RSVP‚Äôs <strong data-start="5485" data-end="5525">bidirectional scalar‚Äìvector coupling</strong> as <strong data-start="5529" data-end="5578">pattern recognition and semantic role binding</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5580" data-end="5696">
<p data-start="5582" data-end="5696">It embodies the <strong data-start="5598" data-end="5632">entropy-minimization principle</strong> as hierarchical agreement across sensory and linguistic layers.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5697" data-end="5826">
<p data-start="5699" data-end="5826">It offers empirical support for your broader claim: that <strong data-start="5756" data-end="5825">meaning, not computation, is the fundamental unit of intelligence</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="5828" data-end="5831">
<p data-start="5833" data-end="6087" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to formalize this relationship in LaTeX‚Äîfor example as a subsection titled<br data-start="5925" data-end="5928">
<strong data-start="5928" data-end="5992">‚ÄúPatom Theory as a Cognitive Instantiation of RSVP Dynamics‚Äù</strong> with equations mapping PT‚Äôs linked-set model to RSVP‚Äôs Œ¶‚Äìùíó‚ÄìS fields and projection operators?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3