RSVP generalizes this as reciprocal exchange between scalar (perceptual) and vector (motor) manifolds‚Äîagain a Œ¶‚Üîùíó feedback loop maintaining low entropy coherence.</p>
<hr data-start="2324" data-end="2327">
<h3 data-start="2329" data-end="2376">5. CLIO Functor and Bidirectional Hierarchy</h3>
<p data-start="2377" data-end="2493">PT‚Äôs top-down/bottom-up hierarchy operationalizes your <strong data-start="2432" data-end="2482">CLIO (Cognitive Loop via In-Situ Optimization)</strong> functor:</p>
<ul data-start="2494" data-end="2719">
<li data-start="2494" data-end="2555">
<p data-start="2496" data-end="2555">Downward projection ‚Ñõ ‚âà language generation / prediction.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2556" data-end="2719">
<p data-start="2558" data-end="2719">Upward adjoint ‚Ñõ‚òÖ ‚âà recognition / assimilation.<br data-start="2605" data-end="2608">
Fixed-points of ‚Ñõ‚òÖ‚Ñõ ‚âà identity correspond to PT‚Äôs recognition equilibrium‚Äîan entropic minimum in RSVP dynamics.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2721" data-end="2724">
<h3 data-start="2726" data-end="2752">6. Epistemic Coherence</h3>
<p data-start="2753" data-end="3057">Ball‚Äôs claim that PT ‚Äúexplains what a brain does, not how it does it‚Äù parallels RSVP‚Äôs treatment of consciousness and physics as <strong data-start="2882" data-end="2907">functional invariants</strong>‚Äîrecursive solvability rather than substrate mechanics.<br data-start="2962" data-end="2965">
PT is therefore the <strong data-start="2985" data-end="3019">cognitive-scale discretization</strong> of your universal entropic recursion.</p>
<hr data-start="3059" data-end="3062">
