</ul>
<h3 data-start="4409" data-end="4459">6.2 Patom Hierarchies as CLIO Recursion Layers</h3>
<ul data-start="4460" data-end="4699">
<li data-start="4460" data-end="4522">
<p data-start="4462" data-end="4522">Each cortical layer = categorical level of CLIO recursion.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4523" data-end="4615">
<p data-start="4525" data-end="4615">Finite neural architecture approximates continuous recursion via sequential adjunctions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4616" data-end="4699">
<p data-start="4618" data-end="4699">This maps PT‚Äôs neurocognitive loop (MTG ‚Üî Broca) onto RSVP‚Äôs Œ¶‚Üîùíó entropic field.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="4701" data-end="4704">
<h2 data-start="4706" data-end="4734"><strong data-start="4709" data-end="4734">7. Neurofield Mapping</strong></h2>
<ul data-start="4735" data-end="4994">
<li data-start="4735" data-end="4802">
<p data-start="4737" data-end="4802">MTG (comprehension) as Œ¶-region: scalar integration of meaning.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4803" data-end="4881">
<p data-start="4805" data-end="4881">Broca‚Äôs area (generation) as ùíó-region: vectorial articulation of meaning.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4882" data-end="4994">
<p data-start="4884" data-end="4994">Bidirectional coherence of these regions maintains S ‚âà 0 ‚Äî functional homeostasis of comprehension and speech.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="4996" data-end="4999">
<h2 data-start="5001" data-end="5051"><strong data-start="5004" data-end="5051">8. Philosophical and Epistemic Implications</strong></h2>
<ul data-start="5052" data-end="5335">
<li data-start="5052" data-end="5097">
<p data-start="5054" data-end="5097">Both theories reject ‚Äúbrain as computer.‚Äù</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5098" data-end="5171">
<p data-start="5100" data-end="5171">Cognition as recursive solvability condition rather than computation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5172" data-end="5257">
<p data-start="5174" data-end="5257">Meaning arises from self-consistent entropic relaxation, not symbol manipulation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5258" data-end="5335">
<p data-start="5260" data-end="5335">PT is therefore the biological instantiation of RSVP‚Äôs universal recursion.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="5337" data-end="5340">
<h2 data-start="5342" data-end="5389"><strong data-start="5345" data-end="5389">9. Empirical and Simulation Consequences</strong></h2>
<ul data-start="5390" data-end="5658">
<li data-start="5390" data-end="5479">
<p data-start="5392" data-end="5479">PT demonstrates how RSVP‚Äôs entropic recursion can manifest in finite neural hardware.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5480" data-end="5553">
<p data-start="5482" data-end="5553">Suggests measurable correlates: entropy minima in EEG/fMRI coherence.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5554" data-end="5658">
<p data-start="5556" data-end="5658">Predicts context-sensitive comprehension even under ambiguous stimuli (verified in PT demonstrations).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="5660" data-end="5663">
<h2 data-start="5665" data-end="5708"><strong data-start="5668" data-end="5708">10. Conclusion: The Cognitive Plenum</strong></h2>
<ul data-start="5709" data-end="6071">
<li data-start="5709" data-end="5813">
<p data-start="5711" data-end="5813">Patom Theory emerges from RSVP by discretization, semantic quantization, and topological projection.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5814" data-end="5951">
<p data-start="5816" data-end="5951">The brain is a finite sampling of the plenum‚Äôs entropic field, operating as a recognition engine in continuous recursive equilibrium.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5952" data-end="6071">
<p data-start="5954" data-end="6071">Therefore, PT provides empirical grounding for RSVP, and RSVP furnishes PT with a physical and mathematical ontology.</p>
</li>
</ul>
