</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{B.1 Variational Objective and Constraints}
Let </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{x},t)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> denote scalar semantic potential, </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{x},t)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> the
vector flow (syntactic/behavioral expression), and </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>S(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{x},t)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> the entropy density.
Generation and recognition are represented by an adjoint pair
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{R} : </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{M}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{sem}} </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\to</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{M}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{obs}}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> and
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{R}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\ast</span></span><span> : </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{M}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{obs}} </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\to</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{M}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{sem}}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.

We define the CLIO variational problem over a time window </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>[0,T]</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{equation}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\label</span></span><span>{eq:clio-functional}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{J}[</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v},S]
= </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{0}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>{T} </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Omega</span></span><span>}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Big</span></span><span>(
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\underbrace</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\tfrac</span></span><span>{1}{2}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{R}[</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>,S]</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{projection mismatch}}
+ </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\underbrace</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\tfrac</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\lambda</span></span><span>}{2}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span> (S - S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\ast</span></span><span>)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{target entropy}}
+ </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\underbrace</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\tfrac</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span>}{2}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\partial</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2 + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\tfrac</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\beta</span></span><span>}{2}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\partial</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{inertial/regularization}}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Big</span></span><span>)</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span> d</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{x}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span> dt,
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{equation}
subject to RSVP coupling constraints (as soft penalties or hard constraints):
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{align}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\label</span></span><span>{eq:rsvp-coupling-1}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\partial</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span>= -</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\cdot</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v} + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{H}(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v},S),</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\label</span></span><span>{eq:rsvp-coupling-2}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\partial</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t S </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span>= -</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\cdot</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{align}
Here </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\ast</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> is the entropy level of coherent interpretation; </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span>,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\beta</span></span><span>,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\lambda</span></span><span>&gt;0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> tune temporal smoothness and tolerance for uncertainty.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>*{B.2 Euler--Lagrange and Adjoint Conditions}
Introduce Lagrange multipliers </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>,</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>S</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> for the RSVP constraints
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\eqref</span></span><span>{eq:rsvp-coupling-1}--</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\eqref</span></span><span>{eq:rsvp-coupling-2} and define the augmented action
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\widetilde</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{J}} = </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{J} + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\partial</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span> + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\cdot</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{H}) + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>S(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\partial</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t S + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\cdot</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v})</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.

Stationarity </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\delta</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\widetilde</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{J}}=0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> yields:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{align}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\label</span></span><span>{eq:EL-v}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v} - </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{R}[</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>,S] - </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\beta</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\partial</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{tt}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v} + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span> + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>S </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span>= 0,
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\label</span></span><span>{eq:EL-Phi}
-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{R}'</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>}[</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>,S]</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\top</span></span><span>}(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}-</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{R}[</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>,S]) - </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\partial</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{tt}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span> + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\partial</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>t </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span> - </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>S </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\cdot</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\!</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v} + </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\partial</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{H}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\,</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span>= 0,
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\label</span></span><span>{eq:EL-S}
