</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Code:} preprocessing (MNE, fMRIPrep confs), CFC/entropy notebooks, CLIO telemetry hooks; versioned (Git) with environment (Conda/poetry).
