 class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="375">Excellent ‚Äî here‚Äôs the next logical and stylistically consistent subsection:<br data-start="76" data-end="79">
<strong data-start="79" data-end="122">‚ÄúImplications for Language Universals.‚Äù</strong><br data-start="122" data-end="125">
It shows how the invariance properties of the RSVP field formalism explain why Role and Reference Grammar (RRG) works across all human languages ‚Äî without relying on syntactic universals ‚Äî by grounding universality in the geometry of semantic fields.</p>
