k markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="183">Here‚Äôs a set of <strong data-start="16" data-end="36">alternate titles</strong>, grouped by tone and audience focus ‚Äî all suitable for your current paper on <em data-start="114" data-end="147">deriving Patom Theory from RSVP</em> and integrating <em data-start="164" data-end="169">RRG</em> and <em data-start="174" data-end="180">CLIO</em>.</p>
