<p data-start="1619" data-end="1849" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">If you like, I can merge one of these directly after your <em data-start="1677" data-end="1683">Coda</em> so the work ends with philosophical symmetry rather than administrative formality.<br data-start="1766" data-end="1769">
