</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\paragraph</span></span><span>{Instrumentation.}
At each CLIO pass </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\(</span></span><span>k</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\)</span></span><span>, log:
