- 2</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\langle</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\times</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>k , </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>k </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\rangle</span></span><span>,
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>
using discrete analogues (finite differences on token-time grid).

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\paragraph</span></span><span>{Oscillation Detection and Q-Factor.}
