<li data-start="660" data-end="977">
<p data-start="663" data-end="710"><strong data-start="663" data-end="708">Package order (minor, but best practice).</strong></p>
<ul data-start="714" data-end="977">
<li data-start="714" data-end="800">
<p data-start="716" data-end="800"><code data-start="716" data-end="726">geometry</code> should come <em data-start="739" data-end="747">before</em> most other layout-affecting packages (fine as is).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="804" data-end="919">
<p data-start="806" data-end="919"><code data-start="806" data-end="814">natbib</code> and <code data-start="819" data-end="829">hyperref</code> should be <em data-start="840" data-end="846">last</em>, because <code data-start="856" data-end="866">hyperref</code> modifies link behavior for citations and references.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="923" data-end="977">
<p data-start="925" data-end="977">So: <code data-start="929" data-end="939">hyperref</code> ‚Üí <code data-start="942" data-end="955">\hypersetup</code> ‚Üí <code data-start="958" data-end="976">\begin{document}</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="979" data-end="1203">
<p data-start="982" data-end="1203"><strong data-start="982" data-end="995">Optional:</strong> you might want <code data-start="1011" data-end="1034">\usepackage{setspace}</code> if you‚Äôre using doublespacing later, or <code data-start="1075" data-end="1101">\usepackage[T1]{fontenc}</code> and <code data-start="1106" data-end="1135">\usepackage[utf8]{inputenc}</code> for full text encoding (though modern LaTeX defaults to UTF-8 now).</p>
</li>
</ol>
