<h3 data-start="2939" data-end="2966">‚úÖ 3. Recompile properly</h3>
<p data-start="2967" data-end="3019">To make the citations work, run in this exact order:</p>
<ol data-start="3020" data-end="3109">
<li data-start="3020" data-end="3042">
<p data-start="3023" data-end="3042"><code data-start="3023" data-end="3042">pdflatex yourfile</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3043" data-end="3063">
<p data-start="3046" data-end="3063"><code data-start="3046" data-end="3063">bibtex yourfile</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3064" data-end="3086">
<p data-start="3067" data-end="3086"><code data-start="3067" data-end="3086">pdflatex yourfile</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3087" data-end="3109">
<p data-start="3090" data-end="3109"><code data-start="3090" data-end="3109">pdflatex yourfile</code></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="3111" data-end="3193">BibTeX needs the <code data-start="3128" data-end="3134">.aux</code> file produced by the first LaTeX run to resolve citations.</p>
