<p data-start="1267" data-end="1300">Then replace the rest with prose:</p>
<blockquote data-start="1302" data-end="1539">
<p data-start="1304" data-end="1539">CLIO minimizes projection mismatch and entropy subject to RSVP coupling.<br data-start="1376" data-end="1379">
The Euler‚ÄìLagrange system yields underdamped uncertainty oscillations whose frequencies correspond to curvature of the recognition landscape (see Appendix C).</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="1541" data-end="1614">That way B functions like an abstract rather than a duplicate derivation.</p>
<hr data-start="1616" data-end="1619">
<h3 data-start="1621" data-end="1657"><strong data-start="1625" data-end="1657">Step 3 ‚Äî Keep D, E, F Intact</strong></h3>
