Ball identifies the posterior middle temporal gyrus (MTG) as the neural locus of word--meaning integration and Broca‚Äôs area as the locus of syntactic realization \citep{ball2020patom}. Within RSVP, these regions correspond to conjugate domains in the scalar--vector pair:
