Equilibrium occurs when the expected and observed entropies coincide, \(\langle \Delta S \rangle_\Omega \approx 0\), recovering the recognition criterion of Patom Theory. Thus, the CLIO adjunction translates Ball‚Äôs empirical ‚Äúlayered agreement‚Äù into a variational principle of entropic equality.

