<h3 data-start="4209" data-end="4256">(g) <strong data-start="4217" data-end="4256">Historical Context Cross-References</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="4257" data-end="4562">
<li data-start="4257" data-end="4562">
<p data-start="4259" data-end="4418">Your historical section is excellent, but you could link the last subsection ‚ÄúToward a Formal Geometry of Recognition‚Äù explicitly to the RSVP‚ÄìPatom‚ÄìCLIO triad.</p>
