<li data-start="4421" data-end="4562">
<p data-start="4423" data-end="4562">Add one bridging paragraph showing how each earlier thinker‚Äôs contribution (Ashby, Gibson, Prigogine) prefigured a specific RSVP component.</p>
</li>
