<p data-start="4564" data-end="4572">Example:</p>
<blockquote data-start="4573" data-end="4790">
<p data-start="4575" data-end="4790">Ashby anticipated the hepatic operator (homeostatic recursion); Gibson‚Äôs direct perception prefigured the scalar‚Äìvector alignment; Prigogine‚Äôs dissipative structures foreshadowed the entropic smoothing term in RSVP.</p>
